  reviewDetails:
  - condition:
      minDays: 1
      maxDays: 3
      minScore: 0.6
      maxScore: 1
      isPositive: 1
    UserName: ILoveCUteCats
    ReviewContent: I loved how much freedom I had in building various tunnels and
      mines. It really does feel like you get to build your own little underground
      world.
  - condition:
      minDays: 2
      maxDays: 3
      minScore: 0
      maxScore: 0.2
      isPositive: 0
    UserName: Abracadabra2000
    ReviewContent: 'Great game! Totally loved when the crafting made infinite dirt!
      10/10 Absolutely, wonderful. Just great. '
  - condition:
      minDays: 1
      maxDays: 2
      minScore: 0.4
      maxScore: 1
      isPositive: 1
    UserName: Abracadabra2000
    ReviewContent: 'A fun time. I liked the monsters creeping up on you silently.
      You really have to be aware of your surroundings while you are digging. '
  - condition:
      minDays: 2
      maxDays: 3
      minScore: 0
      maxScore: 0.4
      isPositive: 1
    UserName: DaResidentPresident
    ReviewContent: 'Not a vibe. Horrible VIBE. Whoever told the dev that the background
      music should sound like an amoeba should go to jail. '
  - condition:
      minDays: 2
      maxDays: 5
      minScore: 0.5
      maxScore: 1
      isPositive: 1
    UserName: Gnome5324924
    ReviewContent: S tier rizzler.
  - condition:
      minDays: 3
      maxDays: 5
      minScore: 0
      maxScore: 0.1
      isPositive: 1
    UserName: PeteEatsDemPeanuts
    ReviewContent: "Never have I ever hated a game more passionately than this. This
      developer needs to be blocked from every single game company ever created.
      They need to be barred from the industry. They are a literal pest, like the
      bugs in this game. It is riddled with them. Someone call the bug busters because
      this is an actual crime against humanity. This game would win worst game at
      the game show awards if they had that for a category. Forget concord, THIS,
      is humanity\u2019s worst enemy. \r\n0/10"
  - condition:
      minDays: 3
      maxDays: 5
      minScore: 0.4
      maxScore: 1
      isPositive: 1
    UserName: GachaTheGotcha
    ReviewContent: Never gonna give you up, never gonna let you down, never gonna
      run around and desert you UwU
